# Master material lives on the designer's machine, not in the repository. It was
# tracked here once and came to 692 MB of the 702 MB checked in — Blender plates,
# 8K PNG renders, the WebP frame archive, the original Webflow export and the Avenir
# OTFs — none of which the site serves. Every one of them is an input to a tool in
# tools/, and every output those tools produce is committed, so the site builds and
# deploys without any of this present.
#
# Restore whichever of these you need before running the matching encoder; the paths
# are the ones the tools expect. See README.md.
/project/
/Falling Blocks/
